# The CloudFront distribution that serves the bundle, the manifest, the figures and llm.txt.
#
# Committed and used in development as well as in a build, so `npm run dev` shows the same tag a
# partner is handed rather than a localhost URL that works nowhere else. The distribution is
# public and sends `access-control-allow-origin: *`, so loading it cross-origin from a dev server
# is exactly what a partner's own page does.
#
# To work against a bundle built on this machine, put this in web/.env.local (git-ignored, and
# Vite prefers it):  VITE_WIDGET_ORIGIN=http://localhost:8080
VITE_WIDGET_ORIGIN=https://d2s2vi2gd7olxb.cloudfront.net
